---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="About ShouldISpend">
  <style>
    :root {
    <title>About ShouldISpend</title>

    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Learn about ShouldISpend — a practical financial decision engine designed to help people evaluate purchases, lifestyle expenses, debt, and major spending decisions."
    />

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #f5f7fa;
        --card: #ffffff;
        --text: #0d1b2a;
        --muted: #64748b;
        --border: #dbe3ee;
        --accent: #14b8a6;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
      }

      .site-header {
        background: white;
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 18px 32px;
      }

      .nav {
        max-width: 1100px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
      }

      .logo {
        font-size: 2rem;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: var(--text);
        text-decoration: none;
      }

      .logo span {
        color: var(--accent);
      }

      .nav-links {
        display: flex;
        gap: 24px;
      }

      .nav-links a {
        text-decoration: none;
        color: var(--text);
        font-weight: 600;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 850px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 80px 24px;
      }

      .eyebrow {
        color: var(--accent);
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 2px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 4rem;
        line-height: 1;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }

      p {
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #334155;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
        padding: 32px 24px;
        text-align: center;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        h1 {
          font-size: 2.5rem;
        }

        .nav {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 18px;
        }
      }
    </style>

    <main class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">About ShouldISpend</div>

      <h1>Practical Financial Decisions, Without the Noise.</h1>

      <p>
        ShouldISpend was created to help people make smarter decisions about
        money without needing a finance degree, investment advisor, or endless
        spreadsheet calculations.
      </p>

      <p>
        The internet is full of financial advice that feels either unrealistic,
        overly aggressive, or disconnected from everyday life. Most people are
        simply trying to answer practical questions:
      </p>

      <p>
        Is this purchase manageable? Is this vacation irresponsible? Is this car
        payment too high? Can I realistically afford this wedding without
        hurting my future flexibility?
      </p>

      <p>
        That’s the purpose of ShouldISpend — a growing library of financial
        decision calculators designed to provide practical verdicts based on
        income, savings, debt load, and long-term financial impact.
      </p>

      <p>
        The goal is not perfection. The goal is helping people make calmer,
        smarter, more informed spending decisions.
      </p>

      <p>
        All calculators and verdicts on this site are educational estimates and
        should not be considered professional financial advice.
      </p>
    </main>
    </Layout>